        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Gusset and cuff sampler, eleven pieces of fine linen, joined together with French seams having gussets set-in at the top and bottom of the seams. The first eight panels have square tops and rounded bottoms simply hemmed. The tops of the last three, wider panels, are gathered into cuffs, each worked with two buttonholes in blue silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/11a6519b-56d0-3ef5-82b4-ca41d9620a89> .

